{"title":"San Diego Math League","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>San Diego Math League</b> (<b>SDML</b>) is sponsored and run by instructors at the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle\" title=\"San Diego Math Circle\">San Diego Math Circle</a> (SDMC), including <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> staff.  The SDML is a five round contest with both a middle school and high school division.  High scorers from the SDML are invited to write the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Olympiad\" title=\"San Diego Math Olympiad\">San Diego Math Olympiad</a> (SDMO).\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#SDML_Winners\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">SDML Winners</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Middle_School\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Middle School</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#High_School\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">High School</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"SDML_Winners\">SDML Winners</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: SDML Winners\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Middle_School\">Middle School</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Middle School\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>2006: Johnny Li</li>\n<li>2005: Vincent Le</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"High_School\">High School</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: High School\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>2006: Vincent Le</li>\n<li>2005: Tedrick Leung</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_League&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018105829\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.009 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 15/1000000\nPost‐expand